// The icon each of these executables carries. linearwin loads a window's big and
// small icon from the resource named LINEARWIN_ICON in its own module, so one
// statement below gives the program its file icon in Explorer, its taskbar icon
// and the icon on its title bar at once.
//
// app.ico is made by scripts/make-logo.py and must not be edited by hand: the
// same geometry is in web/public/assets/linear-mark.svg and in
// include/LogoMark.h, and the script is what keeps the three identical.
LINEARWIN_ICON ICON "app.ico"
